{"4553910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Codex Solis: Purrgatorium", "steam_appid": 4553910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through solar-system, hunt evil entities and survive fast, aggressive space combat built around constant movement, weapon choices, and pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.poster.avif?t=1788285996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.webm?t=1788285996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.mp4?t=1788285996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight evil entities in solar system, you collect psychic cat cards. Then you can use your cat cards to claim land on  planets. For each land you claimed, you are allowed to enter any text you want. If the land is already occupied, you can drive them out if you have the better psychic cat cards deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/d300618d3be2c702c98019031848ba98.avif?t=1788285996\" width=787 height=295 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each conquerable land on a planet is a verse on that planetary holy book. Thus the game allows players to collectively write planetary holy books. The 11 different books is accessible for anyone to read on the games website. Readers can also vote on the verses, affecting their fate in the solar flash. Solar flash is an event that occurs every couple of months, where verses that have lots of dislikes are purged and the game continues with the rest of the verses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/f97bbbc3a9286b10bff7a6258be10ee3.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/f97bbbc3a9286b10bff7a6258be10ee3.avif?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one of 110 psychic  cat cards is based on real cats that are happily living in Türkiye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/2d1d663589ebb5eceb99eb6eb793a4e4.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/2d1d663589ebb5eceb99eb6eb793a4e4.avif?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode where you can just enjoy space battles offline. (With adjustable difficulty and active enemy count).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-widescreen friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional pixelate and CRT effects for more arcade feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Xbox Controller support. (On the main menu and space battle only. You'll need keyboard and mouse to use your cat cards in online mode and to write verses)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/23d16aa4509344f51f983dadac1c0e02.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/23d16aa4509344f51f983dadac1c0e02.webp?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=619 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary power up pickups based on Tarot cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verses written inside the game are visible for everyone on the web on game's website</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/e2c87042cf4e2dc88ae5d2197e09ff80.avif?t=1788285996\" width=1269 height=1272 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through solar-system, hunt evil entities and survive fast, aggressive space combat built around constant movement, weapon choices, and pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.poster.avif?t=1788285996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.webm?t=1788285996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/62565aef46742d532d070981efc19ba9.mp4?t=1788285996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight evil entities in solar system, you collect psychic cat cards. Then you can use your cat cards to claim land on  planets. For each land you claimed, you are allowed to enter any text you want. If the land is already occupied, you can drive them out if you have the better psychic cat cards deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/d300618d3be2c702c98019031848ba98.avif?t=1788285996\" width=787 height=295 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each conquerable land on a planet is a verse on that planetary holy book. Thus the game allows players to collectively write planetary holy books. The 11 different books is accessible for anyone to read on the games website. Readers can also vote on the verses, affecting their fate in the solar flash. Solar flash is an event that occurs every couple of months, where verses that have lots of dislikes are purged and the game continues with the rest of the verses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/f97bbbc3a9286b10bff7a6258be10ee3.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/f97bbbc3a9286b10bff7a6258be10ee3.avif?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=1072 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one of 110 psychic  cat cards is based on real cats that are happily living in Türkiye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/2d1d663589ebb5eceb99eb6eb793a4e4.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/2d1d663589ebb5eceb99eb6eb793a4e4.avif?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode where you can just enjoy space battles offline. (With adjustable difficulty and active enemy count).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-widescreen friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional pixelate and CRT effects for more arcade feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Xbox Controller support. (On the main menu and space battle only. You'll need keyboard and mouse to use your cat cards in online mode and to write verses)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/23d16aa4509344f51f983dadac1c0e02.avif?t=1788285996\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras_big/23d16aa4509344f51f983dadac1c0e02.webp?t=1788285996 width=1560 height=619 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary power up pickups based on Tarot cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verses written inside the game are visible for everyone on the web on game's website</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/extras/e2c87042cf4e2dc88ae5d2197e09ff80.avif?t=1788285996\" width=1269 height=1272 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A shooter game where you fight evil across the solar system and collect psychic cat cards. Use them to conquer land on planets. Each claimed land is a verse in a shared planetary book. Win land, write its verse, and help shape a book anyone can read on the game's website.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/d8d9f0d0cc3627ae109bd2a5e2646fb9067f3e7a/header.jpg?t=1788285996", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4553910/d2cf9821e334a0175e44cadf41912695ca4800fd/